;; Canonical Corner Bracket — Level 01 render source of truth.
;;
;; This is the committed geometry the Level 01 BRIEF render is generated from.
;; It is the same overlap+union relation the mission teaches: a horizontal foot
;; (box 40 8 6) and a vertical flange (box 8 40 6), both centered at the origin,
;; fused by one (union). The 8x8x6 corner where the two boxes cross is the
;; shared volume the union merges into one connected L-bracket.
;;
;; Render pipeline: native Ecky (direct-occt) -> STL -> Three/WebGL -> PNG.
;; Never OpenSCAD. The published PNG is bound to this file by content hash.
(model
  (part bracket
    (union
      (box 40 8 6)
      (box 8 40 6))))
